{
 "hook-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.5,
  "audioFrames": 255,
  "duration": 273,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "老板刚在后台把价格改低，刷新页面，怎么还是旧价？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.7,
    "src": "ch1-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "顾客到底该信哪个？",
    "start": 4.98,
    "dur": 2.2,
    "src": "ch1-2"
   },
   {
    "text": "答案马上来。",
    "start": 7.46,
    "dur": 1.04,
    "src": "ch1-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "copies-1": {
  "audioSec": 5.333,
  "audioFrames": 160,
  "duration": 168,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "copies",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "页面上的价格，多半不是每次都去数据库里查的，而是读的另存的一份。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.32,
    "src": "ch2-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "copies-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.533,
  "audioFrames": 256,
  "duration": 264,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 168,
  "chapter": "copies",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "把它想成一家连锁店：总部有一张价目表，只有它算数，这就是数据库，以 MySQL 八点四点十一为例。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.53,
    "src": "ch2-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "copies-3": {
  "audioSec": 8.933,
  "audioFrames": 268,
  "duration": 277,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 432,
  "chapter": "copies",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "门店货架上的价签，是店员照着价目表抄来的。",
    "start": 0.01,
    "dur": 4.04,
    "src": "ch2-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "缓存就是这样另存的一份，常用的工具是 Redis。",
    "start": 4.33,
    "dur": 4.61,
    "src": "ch2-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "copies-4": {
  "audioSec": 7.267,
  "audioFrames": 218,
  "duration": 226,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 709,
  "chapter": "copies",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "改价要动价目表和价签两个地方，它们没法在同一瞬间一起变，中间总有空隙。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.27,
    "src": "ch2-5"
   }
  ]
 },
 "copies-5": {
  "audioSec": 2.667,
  "audioFrames": 80,
  "duration": 98,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 935,
  "chapter": "copies",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "一致性说的就是让这两份对得上。",
    "start": 0.003,
    "dur": 2.66,
    "src": "ch2-6"
   }
  ]
 },
 "read-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.3,
  "audioFrames": 249,
  "duration": 258,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "read",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "先看顾客怎么查价：货架上有价签就直接看；没有，店员就去查总部的价目表，再抄一张贴回货架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.31,
    "src": "ch3-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "read-2": {
  "audioSec": 9.133,
  "audioFrames": 274,
  "duration": 283,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 258,
  "chapter": "read",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "旁路缓存，英文叫 Cache-Aside，就是这条读的规矩：缓存里没有，才去数据库读，读完写回缓存。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.15,
    "src": "ch3-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "read-3": {
  "audioSec": 5.667,
  "audioFrames": 170,
  "duration": 178,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 541,
  "chapter": "read",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "它适合读多写少的数据，比如商品价格，查的人多，改得少。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.67,
    "src": "ch3-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "read-4": {
  "audioSec": 14.6,
  "audioFrames": 438,
  "duration": 456,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 719,
  "chapter": "read",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "麻烦出在改价的时候。",
    "start": 0.003,
    "dur": 2.08,
    "src": "ch3-4"
   },
   {
    "text": "改数据时有四层：删而不改、先改库再删、删失败了怎么办、主从延迟，最底下还有过期时间兜底。",
    "start": 2.363,
    "dur": 10.33,
    "src": "ch3-5"
   },
   {
    "text": "我们一层一层讲。",
    "start": 12.973,
    "dur": 1.63,
    "src": "ch3-6"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-1": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "第一层 · 删而不改",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch4-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "第一层，先决定价签是改还是撕。",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch4-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "del-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.833,
  "audioFrames": 295,
  "duration": 304,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第一层，先决定价签是改还是撕。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.44,
    "src": "ch4-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "更新缓存，就是总部改完价目表，顺手把门店价签也改成新价。",
    "start": 3.72,
    "dur": 6.12,
    "src": "ch4-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-2": {
  "audioSec": 9.1,
  "audioFrames": 273,
  "duration": 281,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 304,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "问题出在两个改价请求交错：请求甲先改了价目表，请求乙紧跟着又改一次，价目表最后是乙的价。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.11,
    "src": "ch4-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-3": {
  "audioSec": 9.0,
  "audioFrames": 270,
  "duration": 279,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 585,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "可甲去改价签的路上慢了一步，乙先贴好，甲后贴上，价签最后是甲的旧价，一直错下去。",
    "start": 0.01,
    "dur": 9.0,
    "src": "ch4-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-4": {
  "audioSec": 7.767,
  "audioFrames": 233,
  "duration": 241,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 864,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "原因是改价目表和改价签分成了两步，两个请求的步子一交错，后到的旧值就盖掉了新值。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.76,
    "src": "ch4-5"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-5": {
  "audioSec": 7.6,
  "audioFrames": 228,
  "duration": 237,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1105,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "删缓存的办法是：改完价目表，直接把价签撕掉，不贴新的，下次有人查价再照价目表重新抄。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.61,
    "src": "ch4-6"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-6": {
  "audioSec": 6.8,
  "audioFrames": 204,
  "duration": 212,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1342,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "它的代价是，撕掉之后的下一次查价要多跑一趟总部，也就是多读一次数据库。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.79,
    "src": "ch4-7"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-7": {
  "audioSec": 2.767,
  "audioFrames": 83,
  "duration": 91,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1554,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "删缓存一般适合大多数场景。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.77,
    "src": "ch4-8"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-8": {
  "audioSec": 9.367,
  "audioFrames": 281,
  "duration": 289,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1645,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "只有价签算起来很费事，或者刚改完就必须看到新价，而且改价能一个一个排队时，才考虑直接改价签。",
    "start": 0.007,
    "dur": 9.35,
    "src": "ch4-9"
   }
  ]
 },
 "del-9": {
  "audioSec": 6.933,
  "audioFrames": 208,
  "duration": 226,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1934,
  "chapter": "del",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这就是删缓存：只撕不改，两个改价请求谁先谁后，最后都只剩空位。",
    "start": 0.003,
    "dur": 6.94,
    "src": "ch4-10"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-2": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "第二层 · 先改库再删",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch5-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "第二层，是先撕价签，还是先改价目表。",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch5-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "order-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.233,
  "audioFrames": 277,
  "duration": 285,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第二层，是先撕价签，还是先改价目表。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.79,
    "src": "ch5-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "要是先撕价签，顾客一查没有，店员就去总部抄价。",
    "start": 4.07,
    "dur": 5.15,
    "src": "ch5-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-2": {
  "audioSec": 5.433,
  "audioFrames": 163,
  "duration": 171,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 285,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这时价目表还没改，他抄回来的还是旧价，又贴回了货架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.43,
    "src": "ch5-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-3": {
  "audioSec": 7.033,
  "audioFrames": 211,
  "duration": 219,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 456,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "所以要先改数据库，再删缓存，这是旁路缓存的标准写法，读到旧价的空隙小得多。",
    "start": 0.01,
    "dur": 7.02,
    "src": "ch5-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-4": {
  "audioSec": 6.933,
  "audioFrames": 208,
  "duration": 216,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 675,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "它也会出错，只是很少，看这条时间线：查价请求没命中，先读到了旧价。",
    "start": 0.01,
    "dur": 6.92,
    "src": "ch5-5"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-5": {
  "audioSec": 6.467,
  "audioFrames": 194,
  "duration": 203,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 891,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "接着改价请求把新价提交，再删缓存；查价请求这时才把旧价写回缓存。",
    "start": 0.01,
    "dur": 6.47,
    "src": "ch5-6"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-6": {
  "audioSec": 4.4,
  "audioFrames": 132,
  "duration": 140,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1094,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "代价是并发读仍可能回填旧值，得靠后面几层来补。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.39,
    "src": "ch5-7"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-7": {
  "audioSec": 3.367,
  "audioFrames": 101,
  "duration": 109,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1234,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "改数据时，就把这个顺序当默认写法。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.37,
    "src": "ch5-8"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-8": {
  "audioSec": 10.333,
  "audioFrames": 310,
  "duration": 318,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1343,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "有人会再加一招延迟双删：先删缓存，再改库，过一会儿再删一次，只能降低出错的机会，等多久也没有通用的答案。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 10.31,
    "src": "ch5-9"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-9": {
  "audioSec": 5.467,
  "audioFrames": 164,
  "duration": 182,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1661,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这就是先改库再删缓存：空隙最小，但不是零。",
    "start": 0.003,
    "dur": 5.46,
    "src": "ch5-10"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-3": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "第三层 · 删失败了怎么办",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch6-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "第三层，撕价签这一下也可能失败，比如 Redis 一时连不上，旧价签就留在了货架上。",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch6-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "retry-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.0,
  "audioFrames": 210,
  "duration": 218,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第三层，撕价签这一下也可能失败，比如 Redis 一时连不上，旧价签就留在了货架上。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.0,
    "src": "ch6-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-2": {
  "audioSec": 9.7,
  "audioFrames": 291,
  "duration": 299,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 218,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "消息队列重试，是把要删的价签记进一张待删单，后台照着单子反复删，直到删掉；一直删不掉，就转给人工处理。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 9.68,
    "src": "ch6-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-3": {
  "audioSec": 6.7,
  "audioFrames": 201,
  "duration": 209,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 517,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "订阅变更日志是另一种办法：变更日志在 MySQL 里叫 binlog。",
    "start": 0.007,
    "dur": 6.68,
    "src": "ch6-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-4": {
  "audioSec": 6.0,
  "audioFrames": 180,
  "duration": 188,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 726,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "一个独立程序盯着它，看到改价就去删缓存，业务代码不用管删缓存。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.99,
    "src": "ch6-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-5": {
  "audioSec": 3.633,
  "audioFrames": 109,
  "duration": 118,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 914,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "但要说清楚：binlog 本身按提交顺序记录。",
    "start": 0.003,
    "dur": 3.64,
    "src": "ch6-5"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-6": {
  "audioSec": 9.467,
  "audioFrames": 284,
  "duration": 292,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1032,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "问题在时间差：它在提交完成前就写好了，订阅程序可能先收到改动、删了缓存，这时新价还读不到。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.46,
    "src": "ch6-6"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-7": {
  "audioSec": 9.133,
  "audioFrames": 274,
  "duration": 282,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1324,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "消息分到多个分区、多个线程一起消费，再加上失败重试，消费和删除未必按顺序，中间可能有空隙。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.14,
    "src": "ch6-7"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-8": {
  "audioSec": 5.3,
  "audioFrames": 159,
  "duration": 167,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1606,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "代价是多一套组件要维护，重试和过期时间照样要有。",
    "start": 0.017,
    "dur": 5.28,
    "src": "ch6-8"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-9": {
  "audioSec": 5.133,
  "audioFrames": 154,
  "duration": 163,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1773,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "消息队列重试，一般更适合本来就有消息队列、改价地方又不多的系统。",
    "start": 0.01,
    "dur": 5.14,
    "src": "ch6-9"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-10": {
  "audioSec": 6.633,
  "audioFrames": 199,
  "duration": 207,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1936,
  "chapter": "retry",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "订阅变更日志，适合改价入口多、不想动业务代码，还有人维护组件的团队。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.62,
    "src": "ch6-10"
   }
  ]
 },
 "retry-11": {
  "audioSec": 5.367,
  "audioFrames": 161,
  "duration": 179,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 2143,
  "chapter": "retry",
